# Uploaded to Vercel for every project in this repo.
#
# The iOS PWA project (root directory: ios) exports apps/mobile, so apps/mobile,
# packages and ios itself must be uploaded. Only genuinely unused trees are
# excluded here - a bare `ios` or `scripts` pattern also matches ios/scripts and
# broke the PWA build (Cannot find module '/vercel/path0/ios/scripts/build.mjs').
node_modules
.git
*.log
.DS_Store

/docs
/parcel-yatra-startup-pack
